        <h2>
          What Is AI Visibility?
        </h2>

        <p>
          AI visibility describes how an organization, brand,
          product or service appears within AI-generated answers
          and AI-assisted discovery experiences.
        </p>

        <p>
          As users increasingly ask AI systems questions instead
          of relying only on traditional search-result pages,
          organizations need to understand whether their digital
          presence is being discovered, interpreted and represented
          accurately.
        </p>

      </div>

    </section>


    <section class="section">

      <div class="container">

        <h2>
          What Is Generative Engine Optimization?
        </h2>

        <p>
          Generative Engine Optimization, or GEO, is the practice
          of improving digital content and supporting signals so
          information is clear, authoritative, accessible and
          useful to AI-driven discovery systems.
        </p>

        <p>
          GEO complements traditional SEO rather than replacing it.
          Strong technical foundations, useful content, clear
          structure and authoritative information remain important
          across both search and AI discovery.
        </p>

      </div>

    </section>


